  <description>
    <p>
      TuxScale is a free and open source AI-powered video upscaling
      application for Linux.
    </p>

    <p>
      It uses modern AI models to enhance video quality by increasing
      resolution while preserving details. TuxScale provides an intuitive
      graphical interface for selecting videos, configuring AI models,
      and exporting enhanced results.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Upscale videos using AI models</li>
      <li>Simple and modern graphical interface</li>
      <li>Multiple AI model support</li>
      <li>Open source and privacy-friendly</li>
      <li>Designed for Linux desktops</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

